{"id":"n25543-1-8","stage":3,"title":"총리 · 总理","scene":"制度与公共事务","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n25543-1-8-1","ko":"이번 일로 총리가 자리에서 물러났대.","zh":"据说因为这次的事情，总理已经辞职了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이번","meaning":"这次，这回","explanation":"이번：这次，这回","readings":[{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29737","senseId":"1","lemma":"이번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"일로","meaning":"事，事情","explanation":"일：事，事情；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"3","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"총리가","meaning":"总理","explanation":"총리：总理；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"총리","audio":"/audio/4d070d89938ca76b95d5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25543","senseId":"1","lemma":"총리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"자리에서","meaning":"位，位子","explanation":"자리：位，位子；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"자리","audio":"/audio/0f4adfe312e61750897c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60332","senseId":"4","lemma":"자리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"물러났대.","meaning":"退下来","explanation":"물러나다：退下来；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；대：口语中转述听来的话，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"물러나다","audio":"/audio/63b24c053d900afbb2be.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15735","senseId":"3","lemma":"물러나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"da78d4146f0588e8","term":"이번","zh":"这次，这回","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3","entryId":"29737","definition":"马上到来的顺序；或指刚过去的顺序。","pronunciation":["이번"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"事，事情","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"91895","definition":"带有某种内容的情况或事实。","pronunciation":["일ː"]},{"id":"4d070d89938ca76b","term":"총리","zh":"总理","audio":"/audio/4d070d89938ca76b95d5.mp3","entryId":"25543","definition":"辅佐总统、总管国家事务的高级公务员，其为统管国家各部之部长的首领。","pronunciation":["총ː니"]},{"id":"0f4adfe312e61750","term":"자리","zh":"位，位子","audio":"/audio/0f4adfe312e61750897c.mp3","entryId":"60332","definition":"在组织里的职位或地位。","pronunciation":["자리"]},{"id":"63b24c053d900afb","term":"물러나다","zh":"退下来","audio":"/audio/63b24c053d900afbb2be.mp3","entryId":"15735","definition":"放下正在做的事或所占的位置而出来。","pronunciation":["물러나다"]}],"audio":"/audio/1acbabd2e461cd5dc29f.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n25543-1-8-2","ko":"올해만 벌써 세 번째 바뀐 셈이네?","zh":"今年就已经是第三次更换总理了啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"올해만","meaning":"今年","explanation":"올해：今年；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"올해","audio":"/audio/8a0cd9bb73fb17e933c6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67842","senseId":"1","lemma":"올해","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"벌써","meaning":"已经","explanation":"벌써：已经","readings":[{"term":"벌써","audio":"/audio/d038c1cb7ee215cbfcee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58977","senseId":"1","lemma":"벌써","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"세","meaning":"三","explanation":"세：三","readings":[{"term":"세","audio":"/audio/1bcc05bddb3c9e8c0bec.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17194","senseId":"1","lemma":"세","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"번째","meaning":"个","explanation":"번：个；째：名词后缀，构成派生名词。","readings":[{"term":"번","audio":"/audio/dfccc17e2997aa8da631.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26846","senseId":"1","lemma":"번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"바뀐","meaning":"改变，转变，更改","explanation":"바뀌다：改变，转变，更改；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"바뀌다","audio":"/audio/5207e639323d4244d47e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61179","senseId":"3","lemma":"바뀌다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"셈이네?","meaning":"算是","explanation":"셈：算是；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"셈","audio":"/audio/8251fcfdf37bbf0e6a18.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"90338","senseId":"1","lemma":"셈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8a0cd9bb73fb17e9","term":"올해","zh":"今年","audio":"/audio/8a0cd9bb73fb17e933c6.mp3","entryId":"67842","definition":"现在正在度过的这一年。","pronunciation":["올해"]},{"id":"d038c1cb7ee215cb","term":"벌써","zh":"已经","audio":"/audio/d038c1cb7ee215cbfcee.mp3","entryId":"58977","definition":"比想象早地。","pronunciation":["벌써"]},{"id":"1bcc05bddb3c9e8c","term":"세","zh":"三","audio":"/audio/1bcc05bddb3c9e8c0bec.mp3","entryId":"17194","definition":"三个的。","pronunciation":["세ː"]},{"id":"dfccc17e2997aa8d","term":"번","zh":"个","audio":"/audio/dfccc17e2997aa8da631.mp3","entryId":"26846","definition":"表示事情的次序。","pronunciation":["번"]},{"id":"5207e639323d4244","term":"바뀌다","zh":"改变，转变，更改","audio":"/audio/5207e639323d4244d47e.mp3","entryId":"61179","definition":"内容或状态等变化或变样。","pronunciation":["바뀌다"]},{"id":"8251fcfdf37bbf0e","term":"셈","zh":"算是","audio":"/audio/8251fcfdf37bbf0e6a18.mp3","entryId":"90338","definition":"表示某种情况或结果。","pronunciation":["셈ː"]}],"audio":"/audio/9c0ea93a129aaf787a16.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.856,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=25543","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":102,"sequenceScore":2.6827,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["今年就已经是第三次更换总理了啊？","据说因为这次的事情，总理已经辞职了。","啊！浴室的自来水突然不流了。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["据说因为这次的事情，总理已经辞职了。","啊！浴室的自来水突然不流了。","今年就已经是第三次更换总理了啊？"],"answer":2}]}
